SUMMARY:Beginner Yoga at the Vineyard
DESCRIPTION:Beginner Yoga at the Vineyard in Davis Every Saturday Morning July 18 | 9–10 AM\nTicket Includes: Yoga Class\nStart your weekend with fresh air\, gentle movement\, and beautiful vineyard views at Beginner Yoga at the Vineyard!\nWhether you’re brand new to yoga or simply looking for a relaxing way to ease into your Saturday\, this welcoming outdoor class is designed for all experience levels. Our professional instructors will guide you through the fundamentals of yoga with gentle stretches\, basic poses\, and mindful movement to help you build confidence\, improve flexibility\, and leave feeling refreshed.\nSet among the peaceful surroundings of Great Bear Vineyards\, it’s the perfect opportunity to slow down\, reconnect with yourself\, and enjoy a little tranquility before the weekend begins.\n What to Bring Yoga mat Water bottle Towel\nAfter class\, stay and enjoy the beauty of the vineyard. Wander the grounds\, relax with friends\, or return later during our tasting room hours for a glass of award-winning wine.\nBreathe deeply\, stretch gently\, and start your weekend feeling your very best. We can’t wait to welcome you to the vineyard!
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/beginner-yoga-at-the-vineyard-2/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards\, Great Bear Vineyards
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitdavis.org/wp-content/uploads/Great-Bear-Vineyards_23GBV-drone-scaled-zK0eUQ.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Great Bear Vineyards":MAILTO:greatbearvineyards@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
