X-SOURCE-ID:visitdavis
X-SOURCE:Visit Davis
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260730T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260730T183000
DTSTAMP:20260718T180035Z
CREATED:20260718T180035Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260718T180035Z
UID:10002986-1785432600-1785436200@visitdavis.org
SUMMARY:Tai Chi Basics at Great Bear Vineyards
DESCRIPTION:Tai Chi Basics Course at Great Bear Vineyards in Davis  Thursday\, July 30 | 5:30–6:30 PM\nTicket Includes: Tai Chi Class\nSlow down\, breathe deeply\, and find your balance with an evening of Tai Chi at Great Bear Vineyards.\nJoin us every Thursday evening for our Tai Chi Basics Course\, a welcoming introduction to the ancient practice of Tai Chi. Through slow\, flowing movements and mindful breathing\, you’ll build balance\, improve strength and flexibility\, reduce stress\, and leave feeling refreshed and recharged.\nThis beginner-friendly class focuses on the fundamental drills and postures that provide the greatest health benefits while laying the foundation for a deeper Tai Chi practice. Whether you’re completely new to Tai Chi or looking to refine the basics\, everyone is welcome.\n Meet Your Instructor\nDaniel Pfister has practiced Tai Chi for nearly 30 years. He received intensive training while living in Taiwan for five years and later completed his master’s thesis on the effects of Tai Chi stance training on blood pressure. His approachable teaching style makes this class enjoyable and accessible for participants of all experience levels.\nAfter class\, you’re invited to stay and enjoy Thursday Social! Relax with a glass of wine\, challenge friends to a board game\, or simply unwind in the peaceful vineyard setting as the sun begins to set.\nCome discover why Tai Chi is often called “meditation in motion” and experience the perfect blend of wellness\, community\, and vineyard charm.\nWe look forward to moving with you!
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/tai-chi-basics-at-great-bear-vineyards-3/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards\, Great Bear Vineyards
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitdavis.org/wp-content/uploads/Great-Bear-Vineyards_23GBV-drone-scaled-zK0eUQ.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Great Bear Vineyards":MAILTO:greatbearvineyards@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
