SUMMARY:The Alexander McClintock Quartet Live @ The Melon Ball
DESCRIPTION:The Melon Ball in Davis presents… \nThe Alexander McClintock Quartet is a group of up-and-coming Sacramento-area musicians: Pianist Colbe Hunter\, Bassist Claire Seymour\, Drummer JJ Doolittle\, and Davis’ own Alexander McClintock on Saxophone. Come join us as we celebrate the jazz giants that have inspired many others\, including us\, and all the variety of beautiful music that has come out of it. \nAlexander McClintock Instagram\nColbe Hunter Instagram\nClaire Seymour Instagram\nJJ Doolittle Instagram \n$15 General Admission\nDoors open at 7:00pm\nThis is a BYOB event!
